msgid ""
"SIYI MK32 is an integrated remote controller, ground station and wireless "
"digital transmission system which can be used with Ardupilot. Up to 15km "
"range transmission of HD Video, control and telemetry is possible, which can"
" be doubled via the use of the SIYI HM30 in repeater mode."
msgstr ""
"SIYI MK32 是集成了遥控器、地面站和无线数字传输系统的一体化设备，可与 ArduPilot 配合使用。支持最远 15 "
"公里的高清视频、控制和数传传输，通过 SIYI HM30 中继模式可将距离翻倍。"

